{"success":true,"category":"normal","items":[{"text":"Hello, this is a test","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\f16eae25fd6e74e35b1de836c9037012.mp3","play_count":113,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"This image displays a screenshot of a web application interface, likely a \"Development Tools\" or \"API Debug Center.\" The overall design is clean and modern, featuring a mix of white, shades of purple/blue, and gray.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\f2efc3d85db9198536808f132bf2eeb3.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"Here's a comprehensive summary of the elements:","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\3dd88e679d784a7686b1a93787614ff8.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"**1. Top Header Bar:**","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\fc4715d46081392af8c42b69f289ab07.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   On the far left, a **hamburger menu icon** (three horizontal lines) indicates a collapsible navigation.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\90a5d54786ddef5d814e0016436e0ce5.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   In the center, the title \"**API Debug Center**\" is prominently displayed.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\d61f69aaa3483f990c2839a7f5e94abe.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   On the far right, a small circular icon with a stylized \"CA\" (possibly a currency or language selector) is visible.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\a39dc3ef1148ed0d67b7b7a80dc5601d.mp3","play_count":19,"categor