:19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   On the right side of this section, a small gray dot and the text \"**Not logged in**\" are shown, next to a prominent blue \"**Login**\" button. The same \"CA\" icon from the header is also present here.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\022bb8864da72e644eecd86ef64fae0f.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   **Tab Navigation:**","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\f13813fa7562ab31e438388f1efee686.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   Three rounded rectangular buttons serve as tabs or filters:","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\352e56d406ced971cdc9448634108736.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   \"**Tools**\" is active, with a white background and a wrench icon.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\704fc751853d5b012397263dc0a1820b.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   \"**Favorites**\" has a purple background with a star icon.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\174496937f79c90a63372dc3a98712d9.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   \"**Recent**\" has a purple background with a clock icon.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\7a578820111bc798cf2c6431e528fdd6.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   To the right of these tabs, there's an empty, rounded rectangular shape, possibly for another tab or a toggle switch.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\f8e920eeae95a971ce67450bbfcba2b5.mp3","play_count":60,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   **\"Keyword Density Checker\" Widget:**","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\93eafa7821a3d182d531893290777967.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   A white card with rounded corners presents a tool titled \"**Keyword Density Checker**,\" preceded by a play button icon.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\3ca8e6d2971e9f0db13e1a9ca01788cb.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   Below the title, there's a label \"Content:\".","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\22379b943d068d199e50c8c8da1e2553.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   A large, multi-line text area with the placeholder text \"**Paste your content here...**\" is provided for user input.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\af3d0d6f241693e146c827852efd55fc.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   At the bottom of the card, a rounded, purple gradient button labeled \"**Analyze**\" is present, indicating the action to be performed on the entered content.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\2bd2d0bd331104527f10dfeb3cfe49e4.mp3","play_count":18,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"**Notable Details:**","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\35fb6f3efaf5e141fed48a5ccc1b9ec0.mp3","play_count":18,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   The interface uses consistent iconography and a clear visual hierarchy.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\1c01ef98f8b04d159e35d60287119d7a.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   The gradient purple color is used for active states (like the \"Development\" menu item and the \"Analyze\" button) and inactive tabs (\"Favorites,\" \"Recent\").","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\58fc38b1b1f94283dbbaee0158d4a48f.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   The \"Not logged in\" status and \"Login\" button suggest user authentication is a feature of the application.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\b7ccb9907e7c8e24926d77f7a6e289a3.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"},{"text":"*   The small \"CA\" icon appearing in both the header and the main content area might represent a site-specific branding, currency, or language selection.","audio_path":"C:\\Users\\accou\\.core_node\\cache\\voice_subtitle_tts\\b848b4393f795a5f066e7258cb8817e2.mp3","play_count":19,"category":"normal","created_at":"2025-11-28T21:38:29.036518"}],"count":39}